#N canvas 40 40 900 820 12;
#X text 20 15 lr2xhgr~ - stereo to AmbiX: two Haar banks and a divergence (seam-ltm);
#X text 20 45 Creation arguments: divergence yaw pitch roll (degrees) a1 a2 a3 (dB). Defaults: divergence 90 and 0 for the rest. Divergence is the total angle between L and R: L turns by +div/2 and R by -div/2. The trims are shared by both banks. Outlets: W Y Z X (AmbiX ACN)., f 90;
#X text 20 120 The Haar band split is tuned for 48 kHz: at another rate the object warns in the console and the frequency-to-space mapping shifts. Messages move a parameter along a 20 ms ramp \; out-of-range values are clipped. Same DSP as the seam-ltm VST3 plugin., f 90;
#X text 20 190 input;
#X obj 20 220 tgl 19 0 empty empty adc~ 24 10 0 12 #dfdfdf #000000 #000000 0 1;
#X obj 130 220 tgl 19 0 empty empty noise~ 24 10 0 12 #dfdfdf #000000 #000000 0 1;
#X obj 130 260 * 0.1;
#X obj 20 300 adc~ 1 2;
#X obj 130 300 noise~;
#X obj 20 340 *~ 0;
